<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine wage debt at $3.6 bln - Finance Minister.</title>
<headline>Ukraine wage debt at $3.6 bln - Finance Minister.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's wage debt to government workers, doctors, teachers, coal miners and pensioners has grown to 6.72 billion hryvnias ($3.6 billion) Finance Minister Ihor Mityukov said on Friday.</p>
<p>Mityukov, appearing before parliament, repeated government promises to do everything possible to clear the debt, which in May stood at about $2.1 billion.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244-9150</p>
</text>
